the Chairperson;
(ii)
the President;
(iii)
the Pro-President;
(iv)
the Provost;
(v)
the Proctor;
(vi)
the Deans of Faculties;
(vii)
the Registrar;
(viii)
the Chief Finance and Accounts Officer; and
(ix)
such other officers as may be declared by the Statutes to be the officers of the University.
